    "iCloud 默认关闭，仅同步提醒与快捷键；账号、学习资料、目录授权不随配置迁移。解开已校验的发行 ZIP 后手动替换 App，保留数据。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud sync is off by default and includes reminders and shortcuts only. Accounts, learning materials, and folder permissions are excluded. To update, extract the verified ZIP and replace the app. Your data is kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 默认关闭，仅同步提醒与快捷键；账号、学习资料、目录授权不随配置迁移。解开已校验的发行 ZIP 后手动替换 App，保留数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
