      }
    },
    "可在「右上角账号与设置 → 账号与隐私 → 注销账号」发起删除。无扫描历史的普通账号可即时删除；涉及试卷、识别归档或旧数据的申请需核验处理，通常 30 天内完成。申请受理后暂停新增数据，受理不代表已删除，可在 App 内查看进度。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Request deletion from Account & Settings at the top right → Account & Privacy → Delete Account. Standard accounts with no scan history can be deleted immediately. Requests involving papers, recognition archives, or older data require review and are usually completed within 30 days. New data is paused after your request is accepted. Acceptance does not mean deletion is complete; check progress in the app. "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可在「右上角账号与设置 → 账号与隐私 → 注销账号」发起删除。无扫描历史的普通账号可即时删除；涉及试卷、识别归档或旧数据的申请需核验处理，通常 30 天内完成。申请受理后暂停新增数据，受理不代表已删除，可在 App 内查看进度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "号码长期未用或登录环境变化时，服务端可能要求独立验证。不能完成时请联系支持。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If your number has been inactive or your login environment changes, extra verification may be required. Contact support if you can’t complete it."
