    "月订阅和年订阅均可在有效期内继续识别。订阅由 Apple 收费并自动续期，可在系统订阅设置中取消。免费 %lld 张为账号一次性额度，识别失败不扣次数。AI 可能读错，请对照原图核对结果。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Monthly and annual subscriptions let you recognize more images while active. Apple bills and automatically renews your subscription. You can cancel in system subscription settings. Each account gets %lld free images once; failed recognition does not use an image. AI can make mistakes. Check results against the original image."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月订阅和年订阅均可在有效期内继续识别。订阅由 Apple 收费并自动续期，可在系统订阅设置中取消。免费 %lld 张为账号一次性额度，识别失败不扣次数。AI 可能读错，请对照原图核对结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
