    "账号保存家长本人手机号或邮箱、已设置密码的安全哈希、可选昵称、错题照片、识别结果与学习记录。手机验证码用于注册、登录、绑定和恢复；不收集孩子手机号，不用于营销。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account stores the parent’s phone number or email, a secure hash of any password you set, an optional nickname, photos of mistakes, recognition results, and learning history. Phone verification codes are used for sign-up, login, linking, and recovery. We do not collect children’s phone numbers or use numbers for marketing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号保存家长本人手机号或邮箱、已设置密码的安全哈希、可选昵称、错题照片、识别结果与学习记录。手机验证码用于注册、登录、绑定和恢复；不收集孩子手机号，不用于营销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "账号保存邮箱、昵称、做题记录与你上传的试卷及识别结果。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account stores your email, nickname, practice history, uploaded papers, and recognition results. "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号保存邮箱、昵称、做题记录与你上传的试卷及识别结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "账号已变化，已停止本批次。剩余页面请回原账号重新选择；已上传的图片可在原账号核对。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account changed, so this batch was stopped. Switch back to the original account to select the remaining pages and check uploaded images."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号已变化，已停止本批次。剩余页面请回原账号重新选择；已上传的图片可在原账号核对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
